ddressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A gas generator, wherein an inner tube material (3), a filter member (4), and gas producing agent (5) are disposed or charged in a housing (1) and an igniter (6) to burn the gas producing agent (5) contained in the filter member (4) is disposed in the housing (1), whereby a burst material (2) which is formed cylindrically beforehand is installed in the housing (1) so as to close all gas discharging holes (7a) formed in the housing (1).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un générateur de gaz présentant un logement (1) dans lequel sont disposés ou chargés un matériau de chambre à air (3), un élément filtre (4), et un agent produisant du gaz (5). Ce générateur comporte également un allumeur (6), disposé dans le logement (1) et destiné à brûler l'agent produisant du gaz (5) contenu dans l'élément filtre (4). Un corps éclaté (2) préalablement formé de manière cylindrique est en outre placé dans ledit logement (1) de manière à fermer tous les orifices d'évacuation de gaz (7a) ménagés sur ce logement (1).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>